WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
Microsoft Word made document review familiar.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.880
Overleaf gave me equations and a dependable PDF.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.620
GitHub preserved version history, comparisons, and checks.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.500
But moving one manuscript among them kept interrupting the argument.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.440
So I am testing a web-first draft, with LaTeX as the final output, not the everyday workspace.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:19.920
It is still an experiment.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.440
Would it fit your workflow?
